BoneBurst Import (com.module.ta-creator-boneburst-import)
Copyright (c) 2026, Panupun Dev

BoneBurst Import is the authoring side of BoneBurst: it reads the documented
Spine export formats (JSON, .skel, .atlas) and bakes them for the BoneBurst
runtime. It is an original work written from scratch: it contains no code
from the Spine Runtimes and does not integrate them.

Spine is a trademark of Esoteric Software LLC. BoneBurst Import is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Esoteric Software LLC.

